---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../../lib/siteUrl';
---

<Layout title="Known Issues" description="Current known issues and limitations in Varve: complex script shaping, collaboration scaffolding, canvas bleed visualization, and platform constraints.">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="support-page">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href={sitePath('/support')}>Support</a> / Known Issues
      </nav>

      <h1>Known Issues</h1>
      <p class="support-intro">
        Current limitations and known issues in Varve. These are tracked and will be addressed in future releases.
      </p>

      <div class="known-issues-section">
        <h2>Typography</h2>
        
        <div class="issue-item">
          <h3>Complex script shaping not supported</h3>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Not Implemented</p>
          <p>Complex scripts requiring shaping (Arabic, Devanagari, Thai) are not supported. Latin, CJK, and simple scripts work correctly.</p>
          <p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Use Latin or CJK scripts. Complex script shaping is planned for future development.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="issue-item">
          <h3>BiDi text layout not implemented</h3>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Not Implemented</p>
          <p>Bidirectional text (mixed left-to-right and right-to-left) layout is not implemented.</p>
          <p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Use single-direction text. BiDi support is planned for future development.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="issue-item">
          <h3>Rich text per-span editing limited</h3>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Partial</p>
          <p>The rich text data model exists and inline editing works, but per-span formatting (different styles within a single text node) is limited in the UI.</p>
          <p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Use separate text nodes for different styles within the same area.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="known-issues-section">
        <h2>Color & Print</h2>
        
        <div class="issue-item">
          <h3>Bleed not visualized on canvas</h3>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Not Implemented</p>
          <p>Bleed is an export-time parameter and is not visualized on canvas. You cannot see bleed margins while designing.</p>
          <p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Use guides to manually mark bleed areas. Canvas visualization is planned for future development.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="issue-item">
          <h3>8-bit color storage only</h3>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Limitation</p>
          <p>Color storage is always 8-bit RGBA. No 16-bit, floating-point, or CMYK storage at the document level.</p>
          <p><strong>Workaround:</strong> 8-bit is sufficient for most screen and print workflows. Higher bit-depth is planned for future development.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="known-issues-section">
        <h2>Canvas & Tools</h2>
        
        <div class="issue-item">
          <h3>No artboard-local coordinate space</h3>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Limitation</p>
          <p>Canvas uses global coordinates. There is no artboard-local coordinate space.</p>
          <p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Work with global canvas coordinates. Artboard-local space is planned for future development.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="known-issues-section">
        <h2>Collaboration</h2>
        
        <div class="issue-item">
          <h3>Collaboration is UI scaffolding only</h3>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Not Implemented</p>
          <p>Collaboration features (PresenceIndicator, CollabCursorOverlay) are UI scaffolding with no transport or wire protocol. Real-time collaboration does not work.</p>
          <p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Use version control (git) for collaboration. Real-time collaboration is planned for future development.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="known-issues-section">
        <h2>Motion</h2>
        
        <div class="issue-item">
          <h3>No state machine inspector</h3>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Not Implemented</p>
          <p>State machine inspector for complex prototype flows is not implemented.</p>
          <p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Use timeline-based animation for now. State machine inspector is planned for future development.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="issue-item">
          <h3>No rigging or IK</h3>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Not Implemented</p>
          <p>Rigging and inverse kinematics (IK) are not implemented. Types are defined but rendering is deferred.</p>
          <p><strong>Workaround:</strong> Use manual keyframing for animation. Rigging and IK are planned for future development.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="known-issues-cta">
        <h2>Want to help fix these issues?</h2>
        <p>See the <a href={sitePath('/contribute')}>contribution guidelines</a> to help implement these features.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .support-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .support-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-family: var(--font-editorial);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .support-intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .known-issues-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .known-issues-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .issue-item {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .issue-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .issue-item p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .issue-item strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .issue-item a {
    color: var(--text-link);
  }
  
  .known-issues-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-default);
  }
  
  .known-issues-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .known-issues-cta p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
</style>
